      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it’s not permanent, i guess. but the darkness is so much quieter. it's just less work. every time a light goes out, there's this little bit of relief, like i don't have to try so hard to be a person anymore. i'm just so tired of fighting to keep the lights on.",
