    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels more and more inevitable. like, why spend all this energy trying to fix a house that's already empty? sometimes i look at the last few lights still flickering and i just think... maybe it would be better to just turn the master switch off now, while there's still some dignity in it, instead of waiting for the total blackout.",
